    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.test\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12.x\n\n### Description\n\nWhen no cases were collected, the headless session just hangs, instead of terminating.\n\nIf `mini.test` is used in CI/CD it will hang and timeout without reporting any errors.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n```lua\nMiniTest = require('mini.test')\n\nMiniTest.setup({\n  collect = {\n    filter_cases = function(case) return false end,\n  },\n})\n\nMiniTest.run()\n```\n",
